 * Versi 7 — Clean rewrite, full logging, dual-core
 *
 * ARSITEKTUR:
 *   setup()   → cek semua hardware & jaringan, load data
 *   Core 0    → RFID + LCD + Buzzer (responsif, <50ms)
 *   Core 1    → WiFi keepalive + NTP retry + kirim antrian
