 * HARDWARE:
 *   ESP32 + MFRC522 (SPI) + LCD I2C 16x2 + Buzzer aktif
 *   MFRC522: SS=5, RST=4, SCK=18, MOSI=23, MISO=19, VCC=3.3V
 *   LCD I2C : SDA=21, SCL=22, VCC=5V
 *   Buzzer  : GPIO15 (aktif HIGH)
 *************************************************************/

